{{#default_form:Place}}
Places, each inside another place or, at the top, a [[:Category:Worlds|world]]. Every page made with [[Form:Place]] lands here.

{{#forminput:form=Place|autocomplete on category=Places|button text=Create or edit place}}

== Not in any world ==
Places whose '''Located in''' never leads up to a world. Each one needs its '''Located in''' fixed, or the page it stops at created.

{{#invoke:Place|strays}}

